三、参考架构：Sparse Work Harness</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#31-分层">3.1 分层</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#32-七个对象">3.2 七个对象</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#33-五个承重组件">3.3 五个承重组件</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#34-三层-activation">3.4 三层 activation</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#35-compiled-expert-的发布与折旧">3.5 Compiled Expert 的发布与折旧</a></li><li class="toc-level-2"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#四matter-sidecar-与-context-compiler">四、Matter Sidecar 与 Context Compiler</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#41-两种数据层">4.1 两种数据层</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#42-最小-matter-声明">4.2 最小 Matter 声明</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#43-store-govern-retrieve-compile">4.3 Store → Govern → Retrieve → Compile</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#44-context-mutation-preservation">4.4 Context Mutation Preservation</a></li><li class="toc-level-2"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#五human-work-surface">五、Human Work Surface</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#51-三种投影">5.1 三种投影</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#52-表示原语">5.2 表示原语</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#53-review-grammar">5.3 Review grammar</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#54-文档与界面的晋升边界">5.4 文档与界面的晋升边界</a></li><li class="toc-level-2"><a data-mode-link="practice" data-toc-link href="#六work-extension-与隐性知识编订">六、Work Extension 与隐性知识编订</a></li><li class="toc-level-3"><a data-mode-link="pr